      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "voldemort_line",
      "label": "Voldemort's famous line",
      "description": "The phrase 'I know it will be good' is a well-known line from the Harry Potter films, spoken by Voldemort during a pivotal scene. The meme alters this line to 'I nose it will be good' as a pun on his distinctive nose, creating a darkly humorous birthday greeting. This alteration relies on the audience's familiarity with the original line and the character's iconic features.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
