      "instance_name": "dark_humor",
      "label": "Dark humor",
      "description": "A form of humor that derives its effect from morbid, macabre, or taboo subjects. The meme uses dark humor by juxtaposing a celebratory birthday greeting with a menacing, villainous character. This type of humor relies on the audience's understanding of the contrast between the two elements and the potential for discomfort or unease it may cause.",
