      "description": "The textual phrase 'happy birthday i nose it will be good' is mapped onto the visual entity Voldemort, who is depicted with a menacing, distorted expression. The mapping is based on the juxtaposition of the celebratory text with the villainous character, creating a darkly humorous contrast. The pun 'nose' references Voldemort's iconic long, pointed nose, which is visually prominent in the image, establishing a direct link between the text and the visual material.",
