      "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
      "label": "User projected onto the textual message and the visual character",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the textual message 'happy birthday i nose it will be good' and the visual entity Voldemort, as the meme is a direct address to the viewer. The text 'happy birthday' is a direct greeting to the user, and the pun 'i nose it will be good' is delivered by the character Voldemort, who is visually presented as the speaker. The user is implicitly 'you' in the greeting, and the projection is onto both the text and the character who delivers it.",
